Z||000018||rogergarrison||11-16-2001||07:05 PM||||Hey tony, ya gotta go with the flow. last one and you can have your purple topic back LOL From Ferrari Bible:<P>of 365 series 127 were spyders, 1230 were Berlinetta (coupe) Most all coupes are gone, were used in racing, making them hard to find in street drivable examples. (guess thats where my confusion was). I didnt know any real ones were used in MV (stand corrected). A few more pics, without the factory Borani wire wheels.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/365_GTBerlinetta.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/V12_Ferrari.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/365_popup_lites.JPG"> <P>and just to keep it sorta on topic, has anyone seen the brownish gold color on Windstar vans that flipflops to brite purple? that may be cool to do.||||reg||1
